 nThirty-four days before she’s sent to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley
  founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptical film crew to document her ev
 ery move. What begins as an intimate portrait of an enigmatic felon become
 s a mind-bending three-year journey into the abyss. From boundary-pushing 
 directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenheim comes YOU CAN SEE EVERYTHING.
